I've come to absorb you.

00:11:27.562 --> 00:11:28.897
A-Absorb me?

00:11:29.856 --> 00:11:30.690
This bastard...

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:34.360
He's human, but he's absorbing
my spiritual molecules!

00:11:34.611 --> 00:11:35.904
Are you trying to eat me?

00:11:36.154 --> 00:11:38.239
You'll just end up with an upset stomach!

00:11:38.489 --> 00:11:41.659
I am going to willfully
shuffle off this mortal coil soon

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:43.870
and become a powerful vengeful spirit.

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.206
Shit! This bastard's completely lost it!

00:11:46.456 --> 00:11:48.082
Wh-Why would you do that?

00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:49.959
Revenge.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:54.005
I'm going to show all those bastards who
think nothing bad will ever happen to them.

00:11:54.255 --> 00:11:56.883
Show them what true hatred is like.

00:11:57.133 --> 00:12:00.637
And what happens when they
manipulate and use someone.

00:12:00.887 --> 00:12:03.556
You're going to empower me
to achieve that goal.

00:12:06.267 --> 00:12:08.978
It appears I absorbed too many
vengeful spirits at once.

00:12:10.605 --> 00:12:12.065
It got away?

00:12:16.152 --> 00:12:17.195
Hang on a sec.

00:12:17.445 --> 00:12:20.365
What's that got to do with anything?

00:12:20.615 --> 00:12:22.450
That's Mogami himself!

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:25.286
The star psychic of the 20th century,
Mogami Keiji!

00:12:25.536 --> 00:12:27.247
Or what's become of him.

00:12:29.374 --> 00:12:32.085
Please... spare... me...

00:12:32.335 --> 00:12:33.544
Goodbye.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:41.261
As I figured, this is all you're worth.

00:12:41.511 --> 00:12:43.054
You're all so weak,

00:12:43.304 --> 00:12:45.765
I have no reason to let you live!

00:12:46.015 --> 00:12:47.684
How sad.

00:12:47.934 --> 00:12:51.646
Apparently, it's finally my time to shine.

00:12:51.896 --> 00:12:55.316
It's a shame that I'm so bad
at rock-paper-scissors.

00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:59.445
Are you supposed to be a famous psychic?
I don't recognize you.

00:12:59.696 --> 00:13:02.657
Please... God...

00:13:02.907 --> 00:13:06.661
Begone... foul spirit!

00:13:06.911 --> 00:13:08.454
Jodo-sama's getting serious!

00:13:08.705 --> 00:13:09.914
This will be enlightening!

00:13:10.164 --> 00:13:13.376
He's not even bothering with chants
or throwing salt around, huh?

00:13:18.214 --> 00:13:19.257
Que?

00:13:21.426 --> 00:13:22.468
Hey, something's wrong.

00:13:22.719 --> 00:13:24.762
Did he get possessed?

00:13:25.013 --> 00:13:26.848
That's it?

00:13:27.098 --> 00:13:28.766
Hey, explain something to me.

00:13:29.017 --> 00:13:31.686
What makes this guy such a big shot?

00:13:33.813 --> 00:13:35.773
--Here he comes.
--Run, Shigeo!

00:13:38.443 --> 00:13:41.070
Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike!

00:13:41.321 --> 00:13:41.821
A jumping knee strike to knock
a possessed person unconscious.

00:13:41.821 --> 00:13:45.825
"Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike" A jumping
knee strike to knock a possessed person unconscious.

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:46.075
"Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike"

00:13:46.075 --> 00:13:48.536
"Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike"
This is one of Reigen's special attacks.

00:13:48.536 --> 00:13:48.703
"Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike"

00:13:48.786 --> 00:13:49.620
Jodo-samal!

00:13:49.871 --> 00:13:51.873
Sorry! Hey, evil spirit!

00:13:52.123 --> 00:13:54.917
If my intuition's correct,
you're actually Mogami Kei--

00:13:56.377 --> 00:13:58.046
You know who I am?

00:13:58.296 --> 00:14:00.631
Damn, it was true?!

00:14:00.882 --> 00:14:03.968
Why the hell are you possessing that girl?

00:14:04.218 --> 00:14:06.012
Were you into young girls
when you were alive--

00:14:06.471 --> 00:14:08.431
T-Time out...

00:14:08.681 --> 00:14:09.766
He's not stopping!

00:14:11.976 --> 00:14:13.603
Minori.

00:14:13.853 --> 00:14:15.063
Stop this.

00:14:15.313 --> 00:14:17.648
I'll stay by your side.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.735
Get awa...

00:14:30.161 --> 00:14:31.996
He impaled him!

00:14:32.246 --> 00:14:34.624
You can't... be serious...

00:14:36.084 --> 00:14:37.460
I didn't come here to see someone die!

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.003
We can't deal with that monster!

00:14:39.253 --> 00:14:40.046
Run!

00:14:40.296 --> 00:14:41.506
--I-It won't open?!
--No way!

00:14:41.756 --> 00:14:43.424
Let us out!

00:14:43.674 --> 00:14:46.177
Where do you think you're going?

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:49.263
Well, this has gone to shit.

00:14:49.514 --> 00:14:52.266
Mob, you warmed up yet?

00:14:52.517 --> 00:14:53.559
Yes.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:55.978
Well, I'm not actually warmed up at all,

00:14:56.229 --> 00:14:58.272
but I know I have to deal with this anyway.

00:14:58.398 --> 00:14:58.898
"Progress Towards Mob's Explosion

00:14:58.898 --> 00:15:00.274
"Progress Towards Mob's Explosion
77 %"

00:15:00.525 --> 00:15:03.986
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:15:04.278 --> 00:15:07.740
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:15:08.449 --> 00:15:09.575
A demon...

00:15:09.826 --> 00:15:11.828
Shouldn't we run away?

00:15:12.995 --> 00:15:15.540
I'm pretty confident in my abilities--

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:20.294
Spirit Hold!

00:15:27.176 --> 00:15:28.136
Oh?

00:15:28.386 --> 00:15:32.306
I don't know who it is, but someone's
got some decent telekinetic powers.

00:15:32.557 --> 00:15:37.770
It's true that humans can't move
their joints past a certain point.

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.815
But what about a doll's joints?

00:15:44.152 --> 00:15:46.070
Oh, look. I can move.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:49.115
That girl's body...

00:15:52.493 --> 00:15:54.078
Get it now?

00:15:54.328 --> 00:15:57.790
Nothing you do to this body will affect me.
It's not a solution.

00:15:59.125 --> 00:16:02.462
What are you laughing about?

00:16:02.712 --> 00:16:03.838
It's him.

00:16:04.088 --> 00:16:05.923
There is a solution.

00:16:08.301 --> 00:16:10.761
I'll make you disappear.

00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:14.974
Now we're talking!

00:16:15.224 --> 00:16:16.851
Such incredible spiritual power...

00:16:19.187 --> 00:16:20.229
What the hell is that?

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.106
I've never seen anything like it!

00:16:23.566 --> 00:16:25.568
Get out of Minori-san... Now!

00:16:31.699 --> 00:16:32.909
Amazing...

00:16:33.159 --> 00:16:34.368
I thought he was just some kid,

00:16:34.619 --> 00:16:36.579
but he's insanely powerful!

00:16:38.331 --> 00:16:42.001
Forget being possessed!
They're fusing into one now!

00:16:42.251 --> 00:16:44.462
I messed up...

00:16:44.712 --> 00:16:48.424
Master, the situation's gotten even worse.

00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:50.301
You're telling me he's
stronger than you, Mob?

00:16:50.551 --> 00:16:51.719
Yes.

00:16:51.969 --> 00:16:53.095
No way...

00:16:53.346 --> 00:16:56.807
That bastard... He's even livelier now
than when he was alive!

00:16:58.392 --> 00:17:00.394
You done, kid?

00:17:02.146 --> 00:17:03.189
Now's our only chance!

00:17:06.108 --> 00:17:07.860
That bastard actually did it.

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:10.655
He became the most powerful evil spirit...

00:17:10.905 --> 00:17:14.492
Well, if you die and can't pass on,
at least we'll have each other.

00:17:14.742 --> 00:17:16.035
Don't even joke about that!

00:17:16.285 --> 00:17:17.912
I see.

00:17:18.162 --> 00:17:21.582
I can go inside of Minori-san
and expel the evil spirit from within.

00:17:21.832 --> 00:17:22.917
Are you stupid?!

00:17:23.167 --> 00:17:27.421
How's a human like you going
to enter another human?!

00:17:27.672 --> 00:17:29.757
With an out-of-body experience.

00:17:30.007 --> 00:17:31.551
I see...

00:17:31.801 --> 00:17:34.804
But during that time, your body
will be completely defenseless.

00:17:35.054 --> 00:17:39.517
Not to mention her body will resist you!

00:17:39.767 --> 00:17:41.811
But I have no other choice.

00:17:42.061 --> 00:17:46.649
Dimple, could you possess my body
for a while and protect it?

00:17:46.899 --> 00:17:50.486
--Say what?
--No, no! Anything but that, Mob!

00:17:50.736 --> 00:17:52.738
If you let him in,
he'll probably never leave.

00:17:52.989 --> 00:17:55.908
You know what you're signing up for, right?

00:17:58.077 --> 00:18:00.246
Are you seriously going to trust Dimple?

00:18:00.496 --> 00:18:02.248
I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.711
First, I need to lose consciousness.

00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:09.171
Concentrate...

00:18:09.422 --> 00:18:11.841
Has he changed a little?

00:18:12.091 --> 00:18:15.177
Or wait... Is he trying to change himself?

00:18:16.512 --> 00:18:17.722
Whoa!

00:18:18.931 --> 00:18:21.267
Holy shit! Even I can see it!

00:18:24.854 --> 00:18:25.771
He's coming!

00:18:26.022 --> 00:18:27.064
Take that!

00:18:28.399 --> 00:18:29.442
Wait a sec!

00:18:35.323 --> 00:18:37.408
It's no use... I can't move.

00:18:37.658 --> 00:18:41.412
If you don't need this body anymore,
why don't I take it off your hands?

00:18:43.581 --> 00:18:45.249
You dumb-ass.

00:18:45.499 --> 00:18:47.293
It belongs to me now!

00:18:47.543 --> 00:18:49.211
That's what you get!

00:18:50.671 --> 00:18:56.052
Whoa there! I'm not gonna let you
break my precious body that easily!

00:18:58.888 --> 00:19:02.433
Why's there another spirit?
What a nuisance.

00:19:02.683 --> 00:19:03.851
Begone.

00:19:04.101 --> 00:19:05.645
Now, Shigeo!

00:19:08.689 --> 00:19:10.232
So that's your game...

00:19:10.483 --> 00:19:12.151
You must be insane.

00:19:12.401 --> 00:19:15.237
Yeah, he's not a normal kid.

00:19:19.241 --> 00:19:20.701
Go...

00:19:20.951 --> 00:19:23.871
I know you can... win...

00:19:26.707 --> 00:19:28.209
Welcome.

00:19:28.459 --> 00:19:30.419
Is your sense of self still intact?

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:34.882
If you'd made one misstep getting in here,
your soul would've been destroyed.

00:19:35.132 --> 00:19:36.926
Please leave this body.

00:19:37.176 --> 00:19:39.303
You didn't come here to talk, did you?

00:19:39.553 --> 00:19:42.807
Correct, but you seem so human.

00:19:43.057 --> 00:19:45.142
We're currently in a mental world.

00:19:45.393 --> 00:19:48.354
It mirrors the way we see ourselves.

00:19:48.604 --> 00:19:52.525
I'm Mogami Keiji, a former psychic.

00:19:52.775 --> 00:19:54.777
How about we have a little contest?

00:20:00.491 --> 00:20:01.409
A barrier, eh?

00:20:01.659 --> 00:20:03.411
Very impressive.

00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:05.788
Mind showing me a little more?

00:20:09.083 --> 00:20:11.001
He's got his evil spirit face on now.

00:20:15.673 --> 00:20:17.383
Such power...

00:20:23.597 --> 00:20:27.768
You've truly been blessed...
with incredible power...

00:20:28.018 --> 00:20:31.480
That's a ghost... An evil spirit...

00:20:31.731 --> 00:20:33.858
By the way, young man...

00:20:34.108 --> 00:20:38.696
Do you know where spiritual
power or ESP comes from?

00:20:38.946 --> 00:20:41.157
Sorry, but I don't have any more time.

00:20:41.407 --> 00:20:42.450
I'm going to finish you now.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:43.868
Your emotions.

00:20:44.118 --> 00:20:46.579
It all comes from your emotions.

00:20:49.915 --> 00:20:53.753
The biggest distinguishing feature of humans
is how rich and varied their emotions are.

00:20:54.003 --> 00:20:58.090
These emotions are the reason they thrive
and also the reason they fight.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:00.050
Huh...? My powers...

00:21:00.301 --> 00:21:03.012
You can't use ESP anymore.

00:21:03.262 --> 00:21:07.224
I was gauging how you
picture your powers earlier.

00:21:07.475 --> 00:21:09.059
Quite impressive.

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.729
All kinds of emotions
are raging inside of you.

00:21:11.979 --> 00:21:14.815
But for some reason,
you willingly play the part of a puppet.

00:21:15.065 --> 00:21:16.317
Please... leave--

00:21:16.567 --> 00:21:19.862
You still don't get the fact
that you fell into a trap?

00:21:20.112 --> 00:21:22.907
I let you in on purpose.

00:21:24.408 --> 00:21:26.327
Now, here's the million-dollar question.

00:21:26.577 --> 00:21:30.456
People whose lives are filled with happiness,
and people who live in eternal suffering...

00:21:30.706 --> 00:21:33.918
Which do you think harbor
strong emotions more easily?

00:21:34.168 --> 00:21:35.878
The answer is the latter.

00:21:36.128 --> 00:21:38.756
Negative feelings are much more powerful.

00:21:39.006 --> 00:21:43.844
The more stressed someone is,
the richer the energy they hold within.

00:21:44.094 --> 00:21:49.433
Going by that, there's room for
more drastic change in you.

00:21:49.683 --> 00:21:53.103
All you need is a slight change
in how you see the world.

00:21:53.354 --> 00:21:55.105
Want me to help you out?

00:22:00.861 --> 00:22:02.279
It's morning...

00:22:03.447 --> 00:22:05.366
Kageyama Shigeo.

00:22:05.616 --> 00:22:08.035
Here, you're a normal middle schooler.

00:22:08.285 --> 00:22:13.666
I altered your memories a bit,
and made it so you can't use ESP.

00:22:13.916 --> 00:22:17.294
A change in perspective can make
the world a whole different place.

00:22:17.545 --> 00:22:23.092
With that in mind, I'll be observing
how you act without your powers.

00:22:37.022 --> 00:22:42.319
I spilled a seed and lost sight of it

00:22:45.948 --> 00:22:50.828
I'll find it using the color it's dyed in
and watch it grow

00:22:53.539 --> 00:22:59.211
It immediately returned
to the palm of my hand

00:22:59.461 --> 00:23:08.554
But it's still too light and too frail
to reach for the skies

00:23:10.097 --> 00:23:14.393
The world coldly drains away all the heat

00:23:14.643 --> 00:23:18.981
The bright sunshine just isn't enough

00:23:19.231 --> 00:23:23.485
The memories are closing off what lies ahead

00:23:23.736 --> 00:23:28.908
Shake off their warmth
and set off into the distance

00:23:30.159 --> 00:23:35.414
If I let it wither, it'd be over just like that

00:23:35.664 --> 00:23:40.586
But my hope just doesn't fade away

00:23:56.185 --> 00:23:58.938
Huh? What was I doing again?

00:23:59.188 --> 00:24:01.023
I was doing something important...

00:24:01.273 --> 00:24:03.233
But I can't remember it at all.

00:24:03.484 --> 00:24:05.945
Oh, I should hurry up and get to school.

00:24:06.195 --> 00:24:08.656
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 Il Episode 5:

00:24:08.739 --> 00:24:08.906
"Discord
- Choices~"

00:24:08.906 --> 00:24:09.949
“"Discord - Choices~"
"Discord - Choices~."

